458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 397 0 R
/T (PROCTO is a secure and scalable web-based online assessment platform designed to address the challenges of conducting reliable remote examinations in modern education. The system integrates essential learning management features such as course creation, student enrollment, and exam scheduling with advanced online proctoring mechanisms to ensure academic integrity.)
/E (PROCTO is a secure and scalable web-based online assessment platform designed to address the challenges of conducting reliable remote examinations in modern education. The system integrates essential learning management features such as course creation, student enrollment, and exam scheduling with advanced online proctoring mechanisms to ensure academic integrity.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
459 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 397 0 R
/T (PROCTO enforces a controlled examination environment through full-screen mode and browser tab-switch restrictions while continuously monitoring webcam feeds and screen activity. Suspicious events such as camera interruptions or loss of exam window focus are automatically detected and logged with timestamps and visual evidence. Faculty members can monitor exams in real time through a centralized dashboard, evaluate descriptive answers manually, and rely on automated grading for objective questions.)
/E (PROCTO enforces a controlled examination environment through full-screen mode and browser tab-switch restrictions while continuously monitoring webcam feeds and screen activity. Suspicious events such as camera interruptions or loss of exam window focus are automatically detected and logged with timestamps and visual evidence. Faculty members can monitor exams in real time through a centralized dashboard, evaluate descriptive answers manually, and rely on automated grading for objective questions.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
460 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 397 0 R
/T (Built on a cloud-based architecture using React and Next.js, Node.js and Python, and Supabase for database and authentication, PROCTO supports role-based access control for Admins, Faculty, and Students. The platform aims to reduce faculty workload, improve accountability, and provide a practical, scalable solution for secure online examinations.)
/E (Built on a cloud-based architecture using React and Next.js, Node.js and Python, and Supabase for database and authentication, PROCTO supports role-based access control for Admins, Faculty, and Students. The platform aims to reduce faculty workload, improve accountability, and provide a practical, scalable solution for secure online examinations.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
