/T (The Software Requirement Specification for PROCTO defines a secure, scalable, and reliable online examination and proctoring system designed to uphold academic integrity in remote assessment environments. The system addresses key challenges of online examinations by integrating exam management, automated and live proctoring, evidence-based violation logging, and role-based access control within a unified platform.)
/E (The Software Requirement Specification for PROCTO defines a secure, scalable, and reliable online examination and proctoring system designed to uphold academic integrity in remote assessment environments. The system addresses key challenges of online examinations by integrating exam management, automated and live proctoring, evidence-based violation logging, and role-based access control within a unified platform.)
