/P 426 0 R
/T (By enforcing a controlled exam environment, enabling real-time monitoring, and supporting both automated and manual evaluation, PROCTO reduces faculty workload while ensuring transparency and accountability. The clearly defined functional and non-functional requirements provide a strong foundation for systematic development, testing, and future enhancement of the platform, making PROCTO a practical and effective solution for modern online education.)
/E (By enforcing a controlled exam environment, enabling real-time monitoring, and supporting both automated and manual evaluation, PROCTO reduces faculty workload while ensuring transparency and accountability. The clearly defined functional and non-functional requirements provide a strong foundation for systematic development, testing, and future enhancement of the platform, making PROCTO a practical and effective solution for modern online education.)
